    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way home by subway, your phone keeps pushing you abnormal short videos. Before your phone runs out of battery, you need to identify them and swipe them away, otherwise, the subway will never arrive at the station.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it is a normal short video, swipe up. if it is an abnormal short video, swipe left. You can also click on the phone screen to pause the video and observe it carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has two distinct endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 to 60 minutes</p>",
